    constraints: `Harmony constraint (lane transport): this is a DELTA on a ruled chain -- every amendment AM-1..AM-30 and DA-1..DA-10 gets exactly ONE verdict (STANDS / AMENDED / DROPPED) with the line of Boris's that decides it; nothing is silently kept and nothing silently lost. Where Boris's ruling differs from what Resolume does (bars, not beats; 4, 8, 12, 16 ... bars, not powers of two; the out point moved in, never a stretched clip, except a clip shorter than 4 bars; no trigger-style menu, every fire starts at the beginning; a scrubbed clip slides back onto the bar instead of staying off it), HIS ruling is built and each difference is listed in section 6 so that he sees it. The beat lock is MEASURED before it is promised: the first stage is the measurement with a pre-registered decision table (each outcome -> what is built, and the fallback named with what Boris would see), Harmony runs it, and no stage that depends on its outcome starts before she has.`,
